; -----------------------
; RAMS
; -----------------------

; Temporarily disabled: pummels are wasting production time and resources.

; =====================================================
; *** Chapter 5: TL4 ARTILLERY ***
; =====================================================

; Keep MECH/HW artillery from sitting behind TL4 escrow without bloating the
; already-large map/air-alert training rules.
(defrule
	(current-age == tech-level-4)
	(goal combat-arm MECH/HW)
	(can-train-with-escrow SIEGE-ARTILLERY-LINE)
=>
	(release-escrow carbon)
	(release-escrow nova)
	(release-escrow metal)
)

; --- Core Artillery p1 ---
